              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "pōlīsulu vaccāru, kānī doṅga appaṭikē pāripōyāḍu. — The police came, but the thief had already run away.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *pōlīsulu vaccāru, kānī doṅga appaṭikē pāripōyāḍu.* — The police came, but the thief had already run away.]"
