          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "క్షణం (kṣaṇaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit kṣaṇa, \"the twinkling of an eye, a moment\" (CDIAL 3642)."
